| `launcher.farm.adapters.<name>.not_allocated_status` | integer | `slurm` gets `251` | a whole number, 1 to 254, not 126, 127 or 130, unequal to `farm_error_status` | `scripts/launch.py` (`load_launcher_config`); `after_farm` | The status that means the farm did not start the job within the wait: the script then runs here limited when the host is spare, and stops with exit 12 (`NO_CAPACITY`) when it is not. | the farm's own failure: `launcher.farm.adapters.<name>.farm_error_status` | always |
